
== Before Hadoop ==
1997 #                Term 'big data' used by NASA researchers  (9 years before you were born)
2001 ###              Doug Laney describes the 3 Vs  (5 years before you were born)

== Google papers ==
2003 ####             Google File System paper  (3 years before you were born)
2004 ####             MapReduce paper  (2 years before you were born)
2006 #####            Bigtable paper; Hadoop starts; Amazon S3  (you were 0)

== Ecosystem ==
2008 ######           Hadoop top-level Apache project; Hive, Cassandra  (you were 2)
2011 ########         Kafka open-sourced by LinkedIn  (you were 5)
2014 #########        Spark 1.0, Apache top-level project  (you were 8)

== Cloud and mobile ==
2016 ##########       UPI launched; cheap 4G in India  (you were 10)

== Lakehouse ==
2019 ############     Delta Lake open-sourced  (you were 13)
2023 ##############   India's DPDP Act passed  (you were 17)

11 milestones over 26 years; 23 years since the GFS paper.
